  "body": "We switched matrix.org to current `develop` for a couple of hours on 2020-04-24, and saw some surprising changes to the metrics, including a large number of calls to the `get_user_by_id` database transaction.\r\n\r\nSome of these could be due to more accurate metrics reporting due to #7203, but there were other changes which merit investigation.",
